{"symbol":"LEN.WA","area":"poland","updated":"2026-11-09T19:52:52Z","info":{"address1":"Kornicka Street 52","city":"Sroda Wielkopolska","zip":"63-000","country":"Poland","phone":"48 61 286 0300","fax":"48 61 285 4059","website":"https://lenalighting.pl","industry":"Electrical Equipment & Parts","industryKey":"electrical-equipment-parts","industryDisp":"Electrical Equipment & Parts","sector":"Industrials","sectorKey":"industrials","sectorDisp":"Industrials","longBusinessSummary":"Lena Lighting S.A. engages in the manufacture and sale of lighting systems and luminaires in Poland and internationally. It provides investment lighting products, including product novelties, architectural lighting, light-line systems, troffers, medical lighting and clean rooms, industrial lighting, quick assembly lines, floodlights, downlights, spotlights, wall and ceiling luminaires, street lighting, park and city lighting, and accent, emergency lighting, lighting control, and sale products used in warehouse and production halls, commercial premises, and underground car parks or residential construction. The company also offers lighting control solutions and Internet of Things components, as well as Clue Wireless, a lighting management system solution consisting of mobile app and compatible lighting control devices. In addition, it provides light therapy and UV-C disinfection devices, such as surfaces and ceiling disinfection devices; and professional and standard work lighting solutions comprising floodlights, general construction site lighting, portable LED ACCU lamps, machine and incandescent lamps, tripods, headlamps, cable hand lamps, workshop lamps, lamps for car wash, paint shops and auto detailing, electrical materials, and battery hand lamps. Its products are used in public and industrial facilities, office buildings, street lighting, commercial facilities, residential buildings, sport facilities, and HORECA facilities. Lena Lighting S.A. was founded in 1989 and is headquartered i